  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Future Forum 2017-2020 Policy research - Future Forum 2017-2020</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Future Forum 2017-2020 Policy research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Future Forum aims to achieve the following outcomes:

- An increase in the level of policy discourse occurring in the country on a wide variety of core thematic policy areas, particularly in terms of the engagement of students, the youth, women, local grassroots communities, and ethnic, religious and social minorities;
- An increase in the degree to which political parties in Cambodia put peoples policy needs before party politics by establishing their own policy platforms based on peoples voices; and
- A country which: focuses on the future rather than the past; boasts an inclusive democratic and political system; broadens debate in society around core issues in a manner which demonstrates positive values; ensures that development is beneficial for all; embraces diversity; and nurtures a vibrant and active civil society.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Future Forum is  an independent think tank that focuses on research, analysis and public policy. The main objective of the think tank is to encourage intellectual research and thinking, to positively influence the Cambodian policy narrative and stimulate an evidence-based policy debate</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Future Forum &#xe4;r en sj&#xe4;lvst&#xe4;ndig tankesmedja, etablerad i slutet av 2015. I april 2017 inkom Future Forum till ambassaden med en ans&#xf6;kan om st&#xf6;d (uppdaterad den 27 juli f&#xf6;r att reflektera ny aktivitetsperiod; juli 2017-juni 2020). Huvudsyftet med tankesmedjan &#xe4;r att genomf&#xf6;ra oberoende samh&#xe4;llsvetenskapliga studier av h&#xf6;g kvalitet, stimulera en evidensbaserad politisk debatt och d&#xe4;rmed p&#xe5;verka den kambodjanska politiska diskursen p&#xe5; ett positivt s&#xe4;tt. Ambitionen &#xe4;r vidare att inkludera ett brett antal akt&#xf6;rer i arbetet, inklusive politiska partier, regeringen, statsf&#xf6;rvaltningen och det civila samh&#xe4;llet. Ungdomar och studenter &#xe4;r en viktig m&#xe5;lgrupp. En s&#xe4;rskild satsning kommer ocks&#xe5; att g&#xf6;ras f&#xf6;r att f&#xe5; med grupper som inte alltid h&#xf6;rs i debatten, s&#xe5;som kvinnor, gr&#xe4;srotsgrupper och etniska, religi&#xf6;sa och sociala minoriteter. Insatsen kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras under perioden 1 juli 2017 till 30 juni 2020. Det svenska st&#xf6;det uppg&#xe5;r till 3,3 miljoner kronor (54 % av den totala budgeten). St&#xf6;det l&#xe4;mnas som k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till Future Forums verksamhet.</narrative>
  </description>
